# Copy to .env.local (ignored by git) for local builds. On Vercel, add the same name under
# Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables (Production), then redeploy: it is read at BUILD time.
#
# Book a call: public https:// link to the Google Calendar appointment-schedule booking page (Google Meet).
# Leave empty and every "Book a call" button links to /contact#call instead. See docs/booking.md.
VITE_BOOKING_URL=
